title: Root Scene
new-page: true
go-to: post_event if started = 1; start_menu if started = 0

@start_menu
new-page: true

= The Last {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}

## A {!<span class="term term-national-front">!}National Front{!</span>!} campaign, 1949–1951

Version 0.1.0

Build a constitutional coalition through the disputed Sixteenth
{!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!}
election and the struggle over oil nationalization. Historical nationalization
remains fixed; your decisions determine the organization and legitimacy that
survive it.

- @start_game: Begin the Historical Scenario
- @historical_primer: Historical Primer
- @about: About this release

@historical_primer
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
if (typeof window !== "undefined" && window.location) {
    window.location.assign("timeline.html");
}
!}

